    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41587" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rĕ-vī^bro</span></b> ,
			āvi, 1, v. a. and n.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Act.</i>, <i>to cast back</i>, <i>reflect</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">radios,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart. Cap. 2, § 169</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Neutr.</i>, <i>to send back a
				reflection</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ipsa caeli contextio lucis fulgoribus
					revibravit,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart. Cap. 8, § 810</span></i>
			.</div>
